# Environment for the TeiFS service: TEIFS_* variables (any setting) and secrets that
# are only read from the environment, such as webhook tokens. Readable by root and the
# teifs group only.
#
# The root keys, instead of the ones the drive makes on its first start (shown by
# `sudo teifs credentials /var/lib/teifs/drive`):
# TEIFS_ACCESS_KEY=
# TEIFS_SECRET_KEY=
